Package: oasr
Title: Option-Adjusted Spread Analysis for Fixed Income Securities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ariel", "R. H.", email = "ariel@ambientpointcorp.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for option-adjusted spread (OAS) analysis 
    of fixed income securities with embedded options. Provides functions for 
    modeling prepayments, defaults, and interest rates to calculate accurate 
    option-adjusted spreads. Supports various prepayment and default models, 
    including CPR (Conditional Prepayment Rate), CDR (Conditional Default Rate), 
    and time-to-event survival models. Leverages the 'dnsr' package for interest 
    rate modeling and yield curve simulation.
